ne/godot/issues/105485","id":3802001070,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ine6u","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T22:12:12Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T22:12:12Z","body":"The duplication issue was fixed in #114655\n\nNot sure what to do with the issue though, since the stuff the MRP does is not supported and due to dynamic typing I really see nothing we can do about it.\n\nThe MRP essentially assigns a typed array to a an export variable which has untyped arrays. Untyped arrays can reference typed ones so this works in theory. But in practice the type of the typed array is incompatible with the resource system. If you tried to export an `Array[Map.Cell]` this would not compile, but since it's an untyped array it goes haywire at runtime. But I can't pinpoint a spot were we could do error checking for this without major performance impact.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3802001070/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]